d_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"tCO8LJfSvnarbt7_vlFECA","review_id":"U6guWfZsVfqmgJzCtlrb5w","date":"2017-09-17T23:18:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9155259132385254,"text_excerpt":"Best kept secret in Algiers. Crab cakes and pasta over a seafood sauce. AWESOME! Food is reasonably priced. Small, clean pleasant atmosphere."},{"business_id":"tCO8LJfSvnarbt7_vlFECA","review_id":"9B3Y5xgesNiNH07Y227NQQ","date":"2019-07-26T02:42:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9139131903648376,"text_excerpt":"Today, I had the pleasure of trying the crab cakes and seafood pasta from The Kitchen. It was delicious. Two nice-sized, well-seasoned crab cakes were served on top of the best seafood (shrimp and lump crabmeat) pasta that I've had in a looooooong time. It came with a nice salad, simple, yet perfect as a side. My friend had the blackened salmon served on top of seafood mashed potatoes with a salad. He was equally pleased. If you haven't been to The Kitchen yet... get there. You won't regret it! Sorry... I forgot to take pics of my crab cakes... too busy digging in."},{"business_id":"tCO8LJfSvnarbt7_vlFECA","review_id":"dPvutxdm7jzMfN1TyvlXKg","date":"2017-08-27T13:36:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.911636471748352,"text_excerpt":"We had our Algiers One-Meet and Eat there on Friday night 8-25-17 It was our first time trying this place, the Fried Green Tomatoes are awesome and the RedBeans and rice with Smoked Sausage and Corn Bread was like home cooking, delicious We liked it so much that we went back on Saturday and I had the Colossal Burger, it's exactly what it sounds like, huge and delicious, she had the crabmeat stuffed pepper with Mac n Cheese I wanted to try the stuffed pepper she had but that burger filled me up I'll try it next time"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
